{"id":"origine","lemma":"origine","pos":"noun","rank":1695,"glosses":["origin (start place)","origin (place of creation)","start, beginning"],"ipa":"/ɔ.ʁi.ʒin/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/be/Fr-origine.ogg/Fr-origine.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"origines"},"formAudio":{"origines":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-origines.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Son origine reste inconnue.","en":"Its origin remains unknown.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},null,{"g":"rest, remainder"},{"g":"unknown"}]},{"text":"Quelle est l'origine de l'univers ?","en":"What is the origin of the universe?","words":[{"g":"which?"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"universe"}]},{"text":"Ce mot est d'origine grecque.","en":"This word comes from Greek.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"word"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"Ancient Greek","l":"grec"}]},{"text":"Laisse-moi te raconter l'origine de cette école.","en":"Let me tell you about the origin of this school.","words":[{"g":"to leave","l":"laisser"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to recount"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"school"}]},{"text":"Quelles sont les origines des Jeux olympiques ?","en":"What are the origins of the Olympics?","words":[{"g":"which","l":"quel"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"Olympic Games"]]}]}